From 3823863a6392860fbe184a13875c629d347d3345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:41:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash routing so provider
 commands bypass sends

Selected-session messages that start with a slash command token run through the backend command surface instead of the ordinary send path. Codex command execution passes the slash command as the resume prompt argument with empty stdin so the CLI handles it as a command for the existing thread.
